# Normalise line endings across machines.
#
# Without this, Git records whatever the author's OS used, and a file edited on
# Windows then on macOS shows every line as changed in the diff. `eol=lf` stores
# and checks out LF everywhere; Node, Vite and VS Code all handle LF on Windows
# without complaint.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Files that must never be line-ending converted.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

# Generated lockfiles: keep them in the repo, but collapse them in diffs and
# mark them as not-authored-by-hand in GitHub's language statistics.
package-lock.json -diff linguist-generated
